    {
      "id": "2125493739082969203",
      "text": "Juxtaposed with Nikola Jokic's thoughts: \"I really don’t know. For me, every game is the same, so I don’t know why it happens like that.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/VBenedetto/status/2125493739082969203",
      "published": "2026-11-25T07:36:11+00:00",
      "likes": 21,
      "author": "Vinny Benedetto",
      "handle": "VBenedetto",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2113366492872089600/rQ6tlupL_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Asked Jamal Murray if he had any idea why the Nuggets are off to a 4-4 start at home when they’ve previously been so good at Ball Arena. He had enough to say it wouldn’t fit in one screen shot: https://t.co/zByiJOXfQj",
      "quoted_author": "Vinny Benedetto",
      "quoted_handle": "VBenedetto"
    },
    {
      "id": "2125491710272897529",
      "text": "Asked Jamal Murray if he had any idea why the Nuggets are off to a 4-4 start at home when they’ve previously been so good at Ball Arena. He had enough to say it wouldn’t fit in one screen shot: https://t.co/zByiJOXfQj",
      "url": "https://x.com/VBenedetto/status/2125491710272897529",
      "published": "2026-11-25T07:28:08+00:00",
      "likes": 139,
      "author": "Vinny Benedetto",
