    {
      "id": "2125459381705982392",
      "text": "The lineups with Nikola Jokic + 4 bench players have yielded some of Denver’s worst stints this season, always at the end of the first/third Q. It was 80-77 tonight, late third. That lineup gave up a 4-0 run that felt more significant with non-Jokic/non-Murray minutes looming.",
      "url": "https://x.com/BennettDurando/status/2125459381705982392",
      "published": "2026-11-25T05:19:40+00:00",
      "likes": 8,
      "author": "Bennett Durando",
      "handle": "BennettDurando",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1795154218078072832/-zCYtqw4_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2125449488718520604",
      "text": "Christian Braun joked last Friday that he only shoots well in NBA Cup games and hoped every game from now on could be for the Cup. He’s on a heat check in the third quarter against Dallas, and Denver has trimmed a 21pt deficit to 6.",
      "url": "https://x.com/BennettDurando/status/2125449488718520604",
      "published": "2026-11-25T04:40:21+00:00",
      "likes": 24,
      "author": "Bennett Durando",
      "handle": "BennettDurando",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1795154218078072832/-zCYtqw4_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2125443127934865605",
      "text": "Seven of the 10 Nuggets who played in that half committed a turnover. No Julian Strawther.",
      "url": "https://x.com/BennettDurando/status/2125443127934865605",
      "published": "2026-11-25T04:15:05+00:00",
      "likes": 22,
      "author": "Bennett Durando",
      "handle": "BennettDurando",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1795154218078072832/-zCYtqw4_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Nuggets, who have the fourth-lowest turnover rate in the NBA, coughed it up 11 times in the first half against Dallas, most of them live-ball turnovers. Mavericks have outscored Denver 19-2 in fast-break points and that's good enough for a 58-39 halftime margin.",
      "quoted_author": "Bennett Durando",
      "quoted_handle": "BennettDurando"
    },
